The GPU offer snapshot is published here as gpu-offers.json by
scripts/retail/snapshot/write-gpu-offer-snapshot.ts. This directory is kept in
the repository so the writer has somewhere to rename its temporary file to; it
deliberately does not create directories of its own.

The snapshot itself is not committed here by hand. Until a sweep has published
one, the loader fetches this path, receives a 404, and reports 'absent' — which
is a normal state, not an error.
